
Riscbox embedding demo

The browser owns /workspace through 9p. Choose a source tree and click Load tree.
Then try:

    cd /workspace
    make
    make run

Use the file browser to copy a file into the editor, then explicitly Save to 9p.
The file tree updates automatically. No editor changes are saved automatically.
The base disk is EROFS; /tmp, /var, and /home are temporary. doas needs no password.
